## 5. Prohibited Uses

Unless explicitly authorized under a separate Commercial Agreement with the Licensor, you may NOT:
5.1. Resell, rent, lease, sublicense, or distribute the Software or its core engines as a hosted or managed SaaS offering to third parties.
5.2. Embed the Software or its core algorithms into a competing commercial developer tool.
5.3. Exceed the Active Contributor threshold without executing a Commercial Agreement.
5.4. Deploy internal Modifications in production while withholding source code, absent an Enterprise Private Modification Waiver.

